what's going on guys this is rob and for  our video on beyond omega level today we  are returning to the world of marvel  cosmic and we're discussing the stranger  and of course this request comes from a  member of our honor guard over at  patreon so the stranger's origin is  somewhat shrouded in mystery but we'll  go over what it is that we know about  him so the stranger was created by stan  lee and jack kirby and made his debut in  issue number 11 of x-men in 1965 as one  of the earlier antagonists for the team  now what we know about him is that he's  a sort of cosmic scientist and explorer  that becomes curious about earth when he  learns of the presence of superpowered  beings on the planet and so he travels  to earth in order to study them now when  he gets here the stranger encounters the  x-men and the brotherhood of evil  mutants and he kidnaps magneto and toad  to take to his lab to experiment on now  later the stranger decides that humanity  was a threat to the omniverse and that  they all needed to die so he hatches a  few schemes to try and kill them all so  the first thing the stranger does is he  tries to control the hulk's mind and  convince him to destroy the planet but  bruce banner is able to convince the  stranger to abort this plan on another  occasion the stranger decides to wipe  out all life on earth with a device  called the no life bomb but the plans  thwarted by the silver surfer and a  scientist named al harper who was killed  while defusing the bomb now after seeing  this act of sacrificial heroism the  stranger decides that humans have the  capacity for good and that maybe he  doesn't have to kill them all and so for  his first few appearances this is what  the stranger was he would show up try to  destroy the earth and ultimately fail  but later we would learn the stranger is  one of the strongest cosmic entities in  mobile comics if not the single most  powerful guy that you've never heard of  now as far as where the stranger comes  from he claims that he was born of the  collective energy of an intellect of a  race that was being inhabited by the  planet gigantis now after the planet was  conquered the stranger became curious  about the existence of other life  throughout the universe and sets out to  learn as much about it as he possibly  can on one occasion the living tribunal  stated that he offered the stranger a  chance to be his fourth face but the  stranger refused for some unknown reason  to us so living tribunal was left with  this big empty spot on one side of his  head where his fourth face should be but  the living tribunal is said to be second  only to the one above all within the  marvel universe so the fact that he  found this stranger worthy of being one  aspect of his being as opposed to  somebody like oblivion or eternity or  any of the other cosmic entities shows  just how far up in the power hierarchy  this guy is now given that bit of  context it's not surprising that the  stranger possesses a ridiculous array of  powers and feats despite the limited  number of appearances that he's made the  stranger has many superhuman attributes  including strength sufficient enough to  match the god pluto in his own realm and  speed greater than that of quicksilver  or the silver surfer the stranger has  demonstrated an incredible level of  durability by sustaining attacks from  some of the most powerful characters of  the marvel universe he survived an  attack from adam warlock and the gardner  while both were in possession of  infinity stones he's unhurt by an energy  blast from the silver surfer and is  unaffected by a blast of hellfire from  the ghost rider the scarlet witch one of  the most powerful magic users in marvel  comics was unable to overpower the  stranger despite being at the peak of  her power suggesting that he has an  inherent resistance to magical attacks  but the most impressive example of the  stranger's durability is that he  survived an influx of energy from the  infinity union a device that contained  enough energy to create a multiverse now  this feat is also a testament to the  stranger's regenerative healing factor  which is so powerful that he can  re-materialize himself after splitting  himself apart on a molecular level which  means that harming the stranger with any  lasting effect is practically impossible  now in terms of offense the stranger is  able to fire powerful energy blasts  capable of knocking out juggernaut or  changing the orbit of the moon when  working in tandem with galactus and eon  the stranger was able to temporarily  hold off thanos wielding the infinity  gauntlet one of the most powerful  weapons in marvel comics in addition to  forming blast the stranger can  manipulate energy on an insane level  even being able to rip the power cosmic  directly out of the silver surfer the  stranger is able to manipulate time and  matter he's created and subsequently  obliterated a planet can shrink and  increase the size of himself and others  and phase through both solid matter and  energy his manner manipulation is so  advanced that he was responsible for the  creation of ego the living planet and  his brother alter ego not only can he  create ordinary matter but his creations  are sentient and in this case extremely  powerful in their own right now since  ego himself is way beyond an omega level  threat the fact that it was the stranger  who created him definitely puts him on  an even higher level now the stranger is  both telekinetic and telepathic  demonstrating strong enough telepathy to  resist a psychic attack from the  overmind one of the eternals whose  psychic power comes from the combined  psyches of billions of eternals which  simply put means he's one of the  strongest telepaths in the multiverse  furthermore one of the watchers remarks  that the stranger's telepathy would be  able to break his mind if he had not  surrendered now the stranger possesses  cosmic awareness likely due in part to  the many experiments he's conducted  throughout the cosmos his knowledge is  so vast that he's sought out by the  watchers a race of beings whose literal  existence is nothing but watching and  recording what goes on in the universe  they saw this guy out for help on how to  cure a disease that was plaguing them  suggesting they regard him as one of the  most knowledgeable entities in all of  existence so yeah the stranger is  probably one of the most powerful beings  that you've never heard of from marvel  comics and he's always underestimated  right people sleep on the power of the  stranger probably because you just  haven't really seen him all that much  right he hasn't really done enough to  really fully utilize the totality of his  power but i will tell you this this  stranger at full power this guy is a  monster right this guy's power level is  absolutely insane but with that being  said guys we're gonna bring this to an  end thank you guys for watching and i  will catch you all later  peace  you
 

